ecord `status: failure`, `generated_loc: 0`, identical starting/ending commits, and no durable dynamic-access coverage.\n\nInspect:\n- `human-intervention-logs/org.hibernate.orm:hibernate-core:8.0.0.Beta1/gradle-test/gradle-test-2026-09-28T16-19-57-817101Z.log`\n- `human-intervention-logs/org.hibernate.orm:hibernate-core:8.0.0.Beta1/issue-requested-metadata/pi.log`\n- `human-intervention-logs/org.hibernate.orm:hibernate-core:8.0.0.Beta1/issue-requested-metadata/pi-generation-2026-09-28T16-19-01-495713Z.log`\n- `forge/.pending_metrics.json`\n\nManual next steps:\n1. Reapply and verify the javac compatibility changes, then run `compileTestJava` and `javaTest` for the coordinate.\n2. Determine the supported Hibernate 8 Native Image bytecode-provider configuration or update the existing substitutions/build arguments so Byte Buddy does not define classes at runtime.\n3. Run the complete coordinate test and regenerate metadata/coverage only after the two native tests pass.", "textSignature": "{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0bf44d9aa8413bff016aba9410a74887d2b529fd385e12994f\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}], "api": "openai-codex-responses", "provider": "openai-codex", "model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "usage": {"input": 48830, "output": 1169, "cacheRead": 120064, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 687, "totalTokens": 170063, "cost": {"input": 0.19532, "output": 0.02338, "cacheRead": 0.0480256, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0.2667256}}, "stopReason": "stop", "timestamp": 1790612480732, "responseId": "resp_0bf44d9aa8413bff016aba940214b487d2b6dfc24fde506959", "rawStopReason": "completed"}}
